{"id":"n18843-1-7","stage":5,"title":"고이다 · 积","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18843-1-7-1","ko":"지난밤에 비 왔어? 아침에 보니까 웅덩이에 물이 고였던데.","zh":"昨晚下雨了吗？早上看到的时候，水坑里还有水呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난밤에","meaning":"昨晚、过去的那一夜","explanation":"지난밤：昨晚、过去的那一夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난밤","audio":"/audio/127daa39c8f79863bd19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:지난밤:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난밤","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"비","meaning":"雨","explanation":"비：雨","readings":[{"term":"비","audio":"/audio/5e0d62698b44a4342d26.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36681","senseId":"1","lemma":"비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"下，来","explanation":"오다：下，来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"17","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침에","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웅덩이에","meaning":"坑，水坑，水洼","explanation":"웅덩이：坑，水坑，水洼；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"웅덩이","audio":"/audio/ce0ea25f4473410a7808.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71451","senseId":"1","lemma":"웅덩이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물이","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{